# Virtual machine artefacts — never commit these
*.vmdk
*.vmx
*.vmsd
*.vmsn
*.nvram
*.vmem
*.iso
*.ova
*.qcow2
*.vdi

# Credentials and keys — never commit these
*.pem
*.key
*.ppk
id_rsa*
secrets.*
.env

# Raw log exports (keep curated evidence only)
# NOTE: evidence files are always .md (see README, File conventions).
# Never save evidence as .log — it would be silently excluded from commits.
*.evtx
*.pcapng
*.pcap
*.log

# Obsidian vault metadata (workspace state, plugin config, cache)
.obsidian/
.trash/

# OS noise
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
desktop.ini
